# Signing: the PRIVATE key must never be committed. It belongs in the
# SIGNING_SECRET repository secret. cosign.pub IS committed on purpose — it is
# baked into the image so the installed system can verify its own upgrades.
cosign.key
*.key
!cosign.pub

# Renovate config: renovate.json5 is the source of truth (it carries the
# comments explaining each rule). Some editors/JSON-schema tooling auto-generate
# a minified .github/renovate.json alongside it. Renovate REFUSES to run when it
# finds more than one config file, so that artifact must never be committed.
.github/renovate.json

# bootc-image-builder output
/output/

# Local build scratch
*.qcow2
*.raw
*.iso
*.sha256

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Private bare-metal test checklist. Local only, never committed.
notes.md
